<%- include('../partials/header') %>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container narrow center">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our team</p>
    <h1>Credentialed people behind every lesson and plan</h1>
    <p class="lead">Steady Sugar is built and reviewed by licensed and certified professionals. Here’s who they are.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section pt-0">
  <div class="container grid-2 align-center">
    <div class="wire wire-square">Professional headshot</div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Founder &amp; lead coach</p>
      <h2><%= c.brand.coach %></h2>
      <p class="muted"><%= c.brand.coachTitle %></p>
      <p>[Your background in two or three short paragraphs: training and licenses, years in practice, the kinds of people you help, and why blood sugar is your focus.]</p>
      <p>[Your approach: practical changes, no extreme diets, and always working alongside each member’s healthcare team.]</p>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>[License or certification — issuing body, year]</li>
        <li>[Years of experience and number of clients]</li>
        <li>[Professional memberships, publications or speaking]</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="/book-call" class="btn btn-primary">Schedule a free call</a>
        <a href="/quiz" class="btn btn-secondary">Take the free assessment</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-soft">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="center narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Clinical review</p>
      <h2>How we keep the information accurate</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="standards mt-3">
      <div class="standard"><%- icon('stethoscope') %><h3>Content reviewer</h3><p><strong><%= c.brand.reviewer %></strong><br>[Short bio: credentials, practice setting, areas of expertise.]</p></div>
      <div class="standard"><%- icon('shield') %><h3>Sources</h3><p>Lessons and plans are based on <%= c.brand.guidelines %> and peer-reviewed research. Each course lists its references.</p></div>
      <div class="standard"><%- icon('clock') %><h3>Regular updates</h3><p>Content is reviewed at least once a year and whenever major guidelines change. Last full review: <%= c.brand.lastReviewed %>.</p></div>
    </div>
    <p class="center small muted mt-2">Steady Sugar provides education and lifestyle coaching, not medical care. <a href="/legal/disclaimer">Read our medical disclaimer</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('../partials/footer') %>
